# Build context for the DIGITIZER image, whose context is the repo root.
#
# server/docker-compose.yml builds the digitizer with `context: ..` so the service can import
# ai_modules/branch_b_digitization directly instead of forking a copy of it. That is the
# right call for the code, but it means the whole repository is the build context: without
# this file, `docker compose up --build` hands the daemon ~2 GB (node_modules, PlatformIO
# toolchains, Python virtualenvs, training datasets, model weights) to build an image that
# COPYs two files and one package. backend/forecasting/.dockerignore exists for the same
# reason, and its comment records the same surprise.
#
# WHAT THE IMAGE ACTUALLY NEEDS (digitizer/Dockerfile):
#   digitizer/requirements.txt
#   digitizer/app.py
#   ai_modules/branch_b_digitization/
# Nothing below may exclude any of those. This is a deny-list rather than an allow-list on
# purpose: an allow-list that is one pattern wrong fails at build time with a missing COPY,
# and this file cannot be exercised without a running daemon.

# --- version control and tooling state ---
.git/
.github/
.agents/
.claude/
*.log

# --- dependency trees and build output, all reinstallable ---
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
dashboard/dist/
dashboard/.vite/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
venv/
.venv/
**/venv/
**/.venv/

# --- firmware toolchain and build artifacts (hundreds of MB, irrelevant here) ---
edge/esp32/.pio/
edge/esp32/.vscode/

# --- large data that no image consumes ---
# Training datasets, model weights and the recorded telemetry dumps. The digitizer ships
# with its own weights inside ai_modules/branch_b_digitization; these are the raw corpora.
recorded_data_dump.zip.part*
measured-backup.csv
scratch/
ai_modules/branch_b_digitization/skeyspot/CubiCasa5k/
ai_modules/branch_b_digitization/skeyspot/yolo_dataset/
ai_modules/branch_b_digitization/skeyspot/mock_dataset/
ai_modules/branch_b_digitization/skeyspot/data/
ai_modules/branch_a_occupancy/

# --- other services' sources: each has its own build context ---
server/
backend/
dashboard/
edge/

# --- secrets, which must never enter an image layer even by accident ---
**/.env
**/wifi_secrets.h
server/mosquitto/passwd

# --- OS noise ---
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
